{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310420001:0":{"text":"갔나요? ...저, 전...","source_cn":"它们、它们走了吗？……我、我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AFE0BBEE190A714","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310420002:0":{"text":"두려워하지 마. 우리가 있으니 그들은 널 해치지 못해.","source_cn":"别害怕，它们已经没法伤到你了，有我们在呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC57D9B09FCCADDFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310420003:0":{"text":"그리고 저 하얀 늑대 씨도 있잖아. 보여? 저분은 살아있는 시체의 천적이셔! 살아있는 시체는 모두 저분을 두려워하거든!","source_cn":"还有那位白狼先生，看到了吗？他可是活死人的克星，所有的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D3B396098BFD82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310420004:0":{"text":"정말요? ...그, 그럼 이제 무섭지 않아요...","source_cn":"真的吗？……那、那我不怕了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7256B75C7256B3DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310420005:0":{"text":"와, 조금 전에 살아있는 시체를 보고도 울지 않다니, 정말 대단하다! 난 놀라서 다리에 힘이 풀렸을 정도였는데. 넌 크면 대단한 녀석이 될 거야!","source_cn":"哇，刚才你都没有被活死人吓哭，真厉害！我都被活死人吓得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B2454B07212A5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310420006:0":{"text":"좋아, 용감한 어린이, 이제 함부로 돌아다니지 말고 여기에서 우리가 살아있는 시체 쫓아내는 걸 지켜봐 줄래?","source_cn":"好啦，你这么胆大，那就在这里不要乱跑，看我们赶走这些活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AE3C8A176B2FDD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310420007:0":{"text":"음... 고마워요, 형아... 다들 고마워요...","source_cn":"嗯……谢谢你，兔子先生……谢谢你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01387EFFC3C6E1F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:亚历克斯":{"text":"알렉스","source":"亚历克斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}